      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rickjonzz/{size}/1934_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-04-23T15:13:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You could use the Sentinel Tactics minis if you are mini-inclined. I took the covers of the character folders, shrunk them down and printed them on cardstock, and stood them up with paper mini stands. Then when someone was done, they'd knock their hero over and stand them back up when the round ended.&nbsp;</p>",
